# The recall-eval toolchain reads the operator's REAL private Tachi memory.db
# and emits labeled cases + reports that embed real query text and memory ids.
# NONE of that may be committed (privacy line: aggregate numbers only, hand-
# lifted into the PR/issue). Regenerate locally with build_cases.py etc.
# Mirrors tools/zvec-shadow/.gitignore.
cases.local.json
cases*.local.json

# All report artifacts -- detail (.local.jsonl) AND aggregate .md this round
# (a human摘 the aggregate numbers into the umbrella issue by hand).
reports/*.jsonl
reports/*.md
!reports/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.pyc
